      "description": "Real project brief, stage and destination metadata within a quiet lane.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-project\" href=\"#project\"><h3>Coastal story</h3><p>A saved brief for a short creator story.</p><span class=\"ds-stage\">Script</span><div class=\"ds-project-meta\">Instagram · YouTube</div></a>",
